      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hindman%2C_Kentucky"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Hindman Settlement School opened in 1902, drew 162 pupils its first year, and survived three fires before rebuilding in 1912.",
